00:28:22.534 --> 00:28:25.937
It's like the fulfillment you
get from balancing a checkbook

00:28:25.937 --> 00:28:27.205
or knowing your credit's good.

00:28:27.205 --> 00:28:30.275
Like, people just need
that like little things.

00:28:30.275 --> 00:28:32.277
I think that we've
missed the boat on that.

00:28:32.277 --> 00:28:34.446
And I think that we need
to get back to a place

00:28:34.446 --> 00:28:36.014
where we start to evaluate

00:28:36.014 --> 00:28:41.019
how we really grooming our
generations to succeed.

00:28:42.187 --> 00:28:42.987
And right now I think
we're grooming them

00:28:42.987 --> 00:28:44.489
not in the best way.

00:28:44.489 --> 00:28:47.325
Like they, luckily some of
