00:28:49.694 --> 00:28:51.629
We want you to use your voice.

00:28:51.629 --> 00:28:53.231
We want you to understand
how the world really works,

00:28:53.231 --> 00:28:54.666
but there's other
kids who feel like

00:28:54.666 --> 00:28:57.836
if I don't get an A
here, then I'm not worthy

00:28:57.836 --> 00:29:00.038
and that's not, I don't
think that's healthy.

00:29:00.038 --> 00:29:01.306
- Yeah, I don't think so either.

00:29:01.306 --> 00:29:02.540
And you know, I'm just,

00:29:02.540 --> 00:29:04.743
as you're talking
I'm thinking about,

00:29:04.743 --> 00:29:06.478
the many times
throughout the show,

00:29:06.478 --> 00:29:10.148
