that I am their
first introduction.

00:30:08.940 --> 00:30:11.810
And I take that
responsibility very serious.

00:30:11.810 --> 00:30:13.278
And also the rest of the guys,

00:30:13.278 --> 00:30:14.679
we all take that responsibility

00:30:14.679 --> 00:30:16.781
because even though
that's my main focus.

00:30:16.781 --> 00:30:18.716
One of the things I do love
about the rest of the cast,

