especially Jonathan, he and I
connect deep on this is that

00:30:21.686 --> 00:30:24.556
we both are very much
about like mental health

00:30:24.556 --> 00:30:26.424
and like the awareness.

00:30:26.424 --> 00:30:29.327
And we do understand that
there's a lot of people

00:30:29.327 --> 00:30:31.529
who are in countries
because we're,

00:30:31.529 --> 00:30:32.363
you know, it's Netflix.

00:30:32.363 --> 00:30:33.331
So we're global now.

00:30:33.331 --> 00:30:35.667
Like I've traveled now.

00:30:35.667 --> 00:30:38.136
Last year, my family we were
blessed enough to go to Bali

00:30:38.136 --> 00:30:39.404
